# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ROYAL DATA CORE / site-io — single source of truth for what is
# NEVER published. Policy (ADR-009 D1 / RFC-001): the repo surface is
# PRODUCT ONLY — site, pipeline tooling, public operational docs.
# Any artifact below is either internal work material or waste.
# gitleaks (full history) is the backstop for everything textual.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── 1. Internal SDD control plane — LOCAL ONLY, never published ─────
# Constitution, RFCs, ADRs, Gherkin specs, runbooks, copy brief,
# decision reports and the local agent-host plan de controle.
.ai/
.opencode/
/specs/
/specs-*/

# ── 2. Secrets and credentials (contract = .env.example ONLY) ───────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.jks
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
*.gitleaks-report.json
.gitleaks-report.*

# ── 3. Node / package manager debris ────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
.npm/
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── 4. SSG build + test artifacts (regenerated per run) ─────────────
dist/
out/
build/
.astro/
coverage/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
test-results/
.lighthouseci/
.lhciview/
.linkinator/
.linkinator-mirror/
.linkinator-cache/
.log-extract/
*.lrc

# ── 5. Language toolchains beyond Node (local experiments) ──────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# ── 5.1 Brand source files (Inkscape originals — local only) ──────────
# O repo carrega os DERIVADOS otimizados (public/brand/*.webp). O original
# Inkscape (SVG embrulhando raster, > 30 MB) fica na máquina do operador:
# versioná-lo no repo público não agrega valor e consome o budget de §C5.
brand/*.svg

# ── 6. Linters / editors / OS junk ──────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*.bak
*.orig
*.tmp
*.log
.cache/
